  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_01",
      "hash64": "714373C201AC2C23",
      "text": "真不錯……\\n很讚喔，很讚喔～[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_02",
      "hash64": "714374C201AC2DD6",
      "text": "哎～再多讓我看看\\n你可愛的樣子吧……？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_select_01",
      "hash64": "4C7D359ECB837DCA",
      "text": "搭話",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_select_02",
      "hash64": "4C7D349ECB837C17",
      "text": "觀望一下",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_03",
      "hash64": "714375C201AC2F89",
      "text": "對對對，真是個好孩子。\\n啊～好可愛呀～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_04",
      "hash64": "714376C201AC313C",
      "text": "不要動喔……\\n就這樣乖乖的，真可愛！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_05",
      "hash64": "714377C201AC32EF",
      "text": "哇喔！竟然還有這種表情？\\n真是太～上相了！！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_06",
      "hash64": "714378C201AC34A2",
      "text": "這好孩子變得這麼有魅力……\\n壞孩子！這不是反過來變成壞孩子了！？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_07",
      "hash64": "714379C201AC3655",
      "text": "啊啊啊～警報警報！厲害的來了！\\n容量再多都不夠啊！！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_08",
      "hash64": "71437AC201AC3808",
      "text": "哇～！讚到受不了！\\n啊，口水流出來了……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_dog_01",
      "hash64": "9AEC9FD9357003E4",
      "text": "咕咕呼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_09",
      "hash64": "71437BC201AC39BB",
      "text": "助手！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來啦！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_10",
      "hash64": "7146F8C201AF43F9",
      "text": "咦……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳什麼時候開始在那裡的？\\n該不會聽見了我的自言自語吧？\\r\\n如果是的話……拜託！忘了它！！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_11",
      "hash64": "7146F7C201AF4246",
      "text": "我遇到了可愛的孩子，\\n所以忍不住就按下了快門啦。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_12",
      "hash64": "7146F6C201AF4093",
      "text": "在這座森林的這一帶，\\n有人目擊到了赫月的身影。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_13",
      "hash64": "7146F5C201AF3EE0",
      "text": "事情似乎是發生在\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]霧很濃的夜裡[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_14",
      "hash64": "7146FCC201AF4AC5",
      "text": "根據我所聽到的消息，\\n在有霧的夜晚，好像會有\\r\\n跟平常不同的寶可夢們出現！\\r\\n在那裡面一定也有赫月……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_system_01",
      "hash64": "AC9C07C59DD5D67D",
      "text": "沙沙沙沙、沙沙……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_15",
      "hash64": "7146FBC201AF4912",
      "text": "剛才那孩子？\\n又回來了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_poke_01",
      "hash64": "D350742621F5B461",
      "text": "啾咿～呀！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_16",
      "hash64": "7146FAC201AF475F",
      "text": "唔哇！？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_17",
      "hash64": "7146F9C201AF45AC",
      "text": "好痛……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_dog_02",
      "hash64": "9AECA2D9357008FD",
      "text": "咕嚕嚕嚕呼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_select_03",
      "hash64": "4C7D339ECB837A64",
      "text": "去搭救！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_select_04",
      "hash64": "4C7D329ECB8378B1",
      "text": "去保護！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_poke_02",
      "hash64": "D350712621F5AF48",
      "text": "啾咿啾咿啾咿～！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_18",
      "hash64": "714700C201AF5191",
      "text": "痛痛痛……\\n嚇我一跳。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_19",
      "hash64": "7146FFC201AF4FDE",
      "text": "相機也平安無事。\\n助手，謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_dog_03",
      "hash64": "9AECA1D93570074A",
      "text": "咕呼～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_20",
      "hash64": "714A7EC201B25D82",
      "text": "當然也謝謝你囉。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_21",
      "hash64": "714A7FC201B25F35",
      "text": "真對不起阿利多斯。\\n都是因為突然有人類出現，\\r\\n所以牠才會嚇得襲擊過來吧。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_side02_0030_camera_22",
      "hash64": "714A7CC201B25A1C",
      "text": "得搭個帳篷，\\n讓寶可夢們知道有人類在才行！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
